{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手吳業坤的日籍太太濱口愛子今日參加慈善跑活動，提到她早前生日，濱口愛子表示當天在跑步中度過，因老公要到加拿大工作，故出發前已提早慶生。</p><p>問到吳業坤送了甚麼禮物給她？</p><p>她謂：「佢冇送禮物畀我，食餐飯就ok。</p><p>（有乜嘢生日願望？</p><p>）開心健康，想喺香港</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:31.021486+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T13:26:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.537332+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.537332+00:00","content_hash":"b8d3d3d7dfb22c8a468a9eed6c50da20bba464e87bfad61b86e436ff0c666924","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}